### ----------------------------------------
### CONSULTA - Busca por email
### ----------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:3001/api/eventos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "acao": "consulta",
  "buscadoPor": "email",
  "usuarios": [
    {
      "userId": 3,
